      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're looking for a definitive end to the pain, and that kind of finality can feel like the only logical solution to an endless loop. Please know that the exhaustion you feel is real, but ending things isn't the only way to stop the cycle. There are ways to change the momentum, even when it feels impossible. If you are in immediate danger, please reach out to a crisis hotline or emergency services right away.",
